<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Logging - 标签 - 蒜头耿鬼's Blog</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/tags/logging/</link><description>云原生、Kubernetes、DevOps 和 Golang 笔记。</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha.3</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</managingEditor><webMaster>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:03:28 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.2nfree.com/tags/logging/atom.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kubernetes 日志收集（五）- 使用 Kafka 做中间层</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-5/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Sep 2024 15:33:32 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-5/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="前言"&gt;&lt;span&gt;前言&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;之前&lt;a href="https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/"&gt;基于 Fluent-bit Daemonset 的日志收集&lt;/a&gt;中，是由 fluent-bit 直接采集到 elasticsearch 中，当我们的日志量非常大的情况下，这样会造成 elasticsearch 压力过大，甚至会因此丢失日志，所以我们最好在采集器到保存的中间加上一个中间层，我们选择使用 kafka 作为中间层&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kubernetes 日志收集（四）- 基于 Fluent-bit Daemonset 的日志收集</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 18:26:58 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="架构图"&gt;&lt;span&gt;架构图&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%9e%b6%e6%9e%84%e5%9b%be" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;a class="lightgallery" target="_blank" href="https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp" title="/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp" data-thumbnail="/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp' alt="/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-4/fluentbit-daemonset.webp" height="631" width="1201"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;使用 DaemonSet 模式部署 Fluent Bit，使每个 Kubernetes 集群节点都运行一个 Fluent-Bit 容器&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;将 Kubernetes 容器运行时的日志文件夹挂载到 Fluent-Bit 容器中以供采集&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;通过 Kubernetes 提供的相关接口获取采集日志的相关元数据&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="配置方法"&gt;&lt;span&gt;配置方法&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="容器运行时日志解析"&gt;&lt;span&gt;容器运行时日志解析&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%ae%b9%e5%99%a8%e8%bf%90%e8%a1%8c%e6%97%b6%e6%97%a5%e5%bf%97%e8%a7%a3%e6%9e%90" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;通过 Fluent-Bit 的多行日志分析进行日志解析与合并，相关配置如下&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kubernetes 日志收集（三）- Logging operator 中使用 concat 多行合并相关问题</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 May 2024 12:26:58 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-collection-3/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="多行合并出现的问题"&gt;&lt;span&gt;多行合并出现的问题&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%a4%9a%e8%a1%8c%e5%90%88%e5%b9%b6%e5%87%ba%e7%8e%b0%e7%9a%84%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;之前讲到容器的标准输出日志会将每一行打印的日志拆分开&#10;实际日志为：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;2024-03-20 06:31:44.934 ERROR log_test/main.go:19 main.main 日志测试 2024-03-20 06:31:44.934&#10;main.main&#10; log_test/main.go:19&#10;runtime.main&#10; runtime/proc.go:271&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;会被拆分成：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kubernetes 日志收集（二）- 基于 Logging operator 的日志收集</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/kubernetes-logging-colle